{
  "name": "Cross-Border EU VIES VAT Reverse-Charge & Anti-BEC Billing Domain Auditor",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Cross-Border EU VIES VAT Reverse-Charge & Anti-BEC Billing Domain Auditor\n\n**Category:** Finance & Accounting Automation\n\nVerifies European Union cross-border VAT registration numbers against official EU VIES for 0% Reverse-Charge compliance while auditing the vendor's billing email domain (SPF, DMARC, MX) to prevent Business Email Compromise (BEC) wire fraud.\n\n### Run 24/7 on n8n Cloud\nDeploy this schedule without managing servers on **n8n Cloud**: https://n8n.io/cloud/?utm_source=n8n_creator_b2bquantapis",
        "height": 250,
        "width": 440,
        "color": 4
      },
      "id": "wf3-sticky-1",
      "name": "Sticky Note - Overview",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        200,
        60
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Quick Setup (< 2 Minutes)\n\n1. Get a free API key on RapidAPI (**15 free runs/month**, PRO `$19/mo`):\n   `https://rapidapi.com/user/b2bquantapis`\n2. In n8n, create a **Header Auth** credential:\n   - **Name:** `X-RapidAPI-Key`\n   - **Value:** `YOUR_RAPIDAPI_KEY`\n3. Select that credential in both **HTTP Request** compliance nodes below.\n4. Replace `https://httpbin.org/post` in the Escalation node with your Slack, Teams, or Jira webhook.",
        "height": 250,
        "width": 460,
        "color": 5
      },
      "id": "wf3-sticky-2",
      "name": "Sticky Note - Setup",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        700,
        60
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Scoring & Conditional Gate\n\n- The **Code** node merges responses from both engines, removes duplicates, and computes `riskScore` (`0–100`).\n- **High Priority (`riskScore >= 60`)** routes to the real-time **Escalation Webhook**.\n- **Standard / Clean (`riskScore < 60`)** logs a structured JSON audit record ready for Postgres, S3, or Google Sheets.",
        "height": 250,
        "width": 440,
        "color": 6
      },
      "id": "wf3-sticky-3",
      "name": "Sticky Note - Routing Logic",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        1200,
        60
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "rule": {
          "interval": [
            {
              "field": "cronExpression",
              "expression": "0 8 * * 1-5"
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      "id": "wf3-trigger",
      "name": "Scheduled Compliance Trigger",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.scheduleTrigger",
      "typeVersion": 1.2,
      "position": [
        220,
        400
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "assignments": {
          "assignments": [
            {
              "id": "assign-1",
              "name": "countryCode",
              "value": "IE",
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "id": "assign-2",
              "name": "vatNumber",
              "value": "6388047V",
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "id": "assign-3",
              "name": "billingDomain",
              "value": "stripe.com",
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "id": "assign-4",
              "name": "invoiceId",
              "value": "INV-2026-0941",
              "type": "string"
            }
          ]
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "wf3-normalize",
      "name": "Normalize Intake Payload",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.set",
      "typeVersion": 3.4,
      "position": [
        460,
        400
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "method": "POST",
        "url": "https://eu-vies-vat-tax-compliance-auditor.p.rapidapi.com/v2/acts/b2b-quant-apis~eu-vies-vat-tax-compliance-auditor/run-sync-get-dataset-items",
        "authentication": "genericCredentialType",
        "genericAuthType": "httpHeaderAuth",
        "sendHeaders": true,
        "headerParameters": {
          "parameters": [
            {
              "name": "X-RapidAPI-Host",
              "value": "eu-vies-vat-tax-compliance-auditor.p.rapidapi.com"
            },
            {
              "name": "Content-Type",
              "value": "application/json"
            }
          ]
        },
        "sendBody": true,
        "specifyBody": "json",
        "jsonBody": "{\"vatNumbers\": [{\"countryCode\": \"={{ $json.countryCode }}\", \"vatNumber\": \"={{ $json.vatNumber }}\"}]}",
        "options": {
          "timeout": 45000
        }
      },
      "id": "wf3-http-1",
      "name": "Primary Compliance Engine",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.2,
      "position": [
        720,
        400
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "method": "POST",
        "url": "https://global-b2b-email-domain-security-auditor.p.rapidapi.com/v2/acts/b2b-quant-apis~global-b2b-email-domain-security-auditor/run-sync-get-dataset-items",
        "authentication": "genericCredentialType",
        "genericAuthType": "httpHeaderAuth",
        "sendHeaders": true,
        "headerParameters": {
          "parameters": [
            {
              "name": "X-RapidAPI-Host",
              "value": "global-b2b-email-domain-security-auditor.p.rapidapi.com"
            },
            {
              "name": "Content-Type",
              "value": "application/json"
            }
          ]
        },
        "sendBody": true,
        "specifyBody": "json",
        "jsonBody": "{\"domains\": [\"={{ $('Normalize Intake Payload').item.json.billingDomain }}\"], \"checkDmarcSpf\": true}",
        "options": {
          "timeout": 45000
        }
      },
      "id": "wf3-http-2",
      "name": "Secondary Verification Engine",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.2,
      "position": [
        980,
        400
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "jsCode": "const intake = $('Normalize Intake Payload').first().json;\nconst primaryItems = $('Primary Compliance Engine').all().map(i => i.json);\nconst secondaryItems = $input.all().map(i => i.json);\nconst combinedCount = primaryItems.length + secondaryItems.length;\nconst serialized = JSON.stringify({ primaryItems, secondaryItems }).toLowerCase();\nlet riskScore = 20;\nif (serialized.includes('critical') || serialized.includes('sanction') || serialized.includes('invalid') || serialized.includes('ransomware')) {\n  riskScore = 85;\n} else if (combinedCount > 0) {\n  riskScore = 65;\n}\nreturn [{\n  json: {\n    auditedAtUtc: new Date().toISOString(),\n    workflowSlug: '03_cross_border_eu_vies_vat_email_domain_auditor',\n    intakeSummary: intake,\n    primaryFindingsCount: primaryItems.length,\n    secondaryFindingsCount: secondaryItems.length,\n    riskScore,\n    requiresAction: riskScore >= 60\n  }\n}];"
      },
      "id": "wf3-score",
      "name": "Correlate & Score Findings",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        1240,
        400
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "conditions": {
          "options": {
            "caseSensitive": true,
            "leftValue": "",
            "typeValidation": "strict"
          },
          "conditions": [
            {
              "id": "cond-3",
              "leftValue": "={{ $json.riskScore }}",
              "rightValue": 60,
              "operator": {
                "type": "number",
                "operation": "gte"
              }
            }
          ],
          "combinator": "and"
        }
      },
      "id": "wf3-if-gate",
      "name": "Priority Gate (Score >= 60)",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.if",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        1500,
        400
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "method": "POST",
        "url": "https://httpbin.org/post",
        "sendBody": true,
        "specifyBody": "json",
        "jsonBody": "={{ JSON.stringify($json) }}",
        "options": {
          "timeout": 15000
        }
      },
      "id": "wf3-escalate",
      "name": "Dispatch Priority Alert Webhook",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.2,
      "position": [
        1780,
        280
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "assignments": {
          "assignments": [
            {
              "id": "audit-status",
              "name": "complianceStatus",
              "value": "CLEARED_ARCHIVED",
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "id": "audit-ts",
              "name": "archivedAtUtc",
              "value": "={{ $json.auditedAtUtc }}",
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "id": "audit-score",
              "name": "riskScore",
              "value": "={{ $json.riskScore }}",
              "type": "number"
            }
          ]
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "wf3-archive",
      "name": "Format Clean Audit Ledger Record",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.set",
      "typeVersion": 3.4,
      "position": [
        1780,
        520
      ]
    }
